BT /F1 10 Tf 40 800 Td 13 TL (OFFICIAL TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION DATASHEET) ' (MANUFACTURER: WAAREE ENERGIES) ' (MODEL / SERIES: Bi-55-540 \(Ahnay Series\)) ' (DOCUMENT TITLE: Waaree Ahnay Series Bi-55 Framed Dual Glass Bifacial Module Datasheet) ' (REVISION / DATE: DS-BI-55-Rev03-2022 | Published: 2022-09-01) ' (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) ' (1. PRODUCT IDENTIFICATION & ARCHITECTURE) ' (  Cell Technology:         Monocrystalline PERC) ' (  Module Construction:     Bifacial \(Glass-Glass\)) ' (  Number of Cells / Format:144 Half-cut Mono PERC Cells \(M10 91x182 mm format\)) ' (  Glass / Front Encapsulant:2.0 mm Low Iron HTAR semi-tempered front & back glass) ' (  Frame Material:          Anodized Aluminium Alloy) ' (  Junction Box / Protection: IP68 weatherproof with 3 bypass diodes) ' () ' (2. ELECTRICAL CHARACTERISTICS AT STC \(1000 W/m2, 25C, AM 1.5\)) ' (  Nominal Maximum Power \(Pmax / Pnom\): 540.0 Wp) ' (  Module Aperture Efficiency:           20.98 %) ' (  Open Circuit Voltage \(Voc\):            49.61 V) ' (  Short Circuit Current \(Isc\):           13.83 A) ' (  Maximum Power Voltage \(Vmp\):           41.75 V) ' (  Maximum Power Current \(Imp\):           12.95 A) ' (  Maximum System Voltage:                1500.0 V DC) ' (  Maximum Series Fuse Rating:            30.0 A) ' () ' (3. TEMPERATURE CHARACTERISTICS & OPERATING LIMITS) ' (  Temp. Coefficient of Pmax \(gamma\):    -0.340 %/C) ' (  Temp. Coefficient of Voc \(beta\):      -0.250 %/C) ' (  Temp. Coefficient of Isc \(alpha\):     +0.050 %/C) ' (  Nominal Cell Temperature \(NOCT/NMOT\):  43 +/- 2 C \(NOCT\)) ' (  Operating Temperature Range:           -40 C to +85 C) ' () ' (4. MECHANICAL DIMENSIONS & RATINGS) ' (  Length:                               2272.0 mm) ' (  Width:                                1133.0 mm) ' (  Thickness \(Height\):                   35.0 mm) ' (  Gross Aperture Area:                  2.5742 m2) ' (  Module Weight:                        32.5 kg) ' (  Mechanical Design Load \(Front\):       5400 Pa \(Snow load\)) ' (  Mechanical Design Load \(Rear\):        2400 Pa \(Wind load\)) ' () ' (5. WARRANTY & LIFETIME PERFORMANCE) ' (  Product Workmanship Warranty:         12.0 Years) ' (  Linear Power Output Warranty:         30.0 Years) ' (  Annual Linear Degradation:            0.45 % / year) ' (  End of Warranty Retained Output:      84.8 %) ' () ' (6. PROVENANCE & ARCHIVAL METADATA) ' (  Authoritative URL: https://www.waaree.com/datasheets/Waaree_Bi-55_Dual_Glass_Bifacial.pdf) ' (  Document Verification: OFFICIAL_FAMILY_DOCUMENT) ' (  Installation Mapping: BENCHMARK_REFERENCE_MODULE) ' (  Verification Date: 2026-11-10) ' (--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) ' (SolarSelect MLOps Hardware Database Reference Standard IEC 61215 / IEC 61730) ' ET
